      &lt;td style='width: 184px; height: 90px; font-weight: bold;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td colspan='3' rowspan='1' style='height: 90px; width: 291px;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;A huge dust wall crossed the metro Phoenix area and drastically reduced visibility, halting all flights coming in and out of Phoenix Sky Harbor Airport until conditions improved. Winds ripped up trees, tossed around lawn furniture and caused hazardous driving conditions.&amp;nbsp;
